description_text:
3D model of wire basket display for chocolate bars. Created in two resolutions: hi-res and low poly (3730 faces).
Model is available in the following formats:

  - STEP (solid geometry) ;

  - STL (hi-res) ;

  - FBX (hi-res) ;

  - FBX (low res) ;

  - OBJ ;

  - COLLADA ;

  - WRML ;
